---
// HowItWorks — 01 Define → 02 Apply → 03 Synced.
// Numbers earned: the sequence IS the information. Transcript lines are
// verbatim CLI output markers (✔ Linked, ✔ OK, Status: All good).
---

<section class="how-section" aria-labelledby="how-heading">
	<h2 id="how-heading" class="how-heading">How AgentSync works</h2>
	<ol class="how-grid" role="list">
		<li class="how-step">
			<span class="how-num" aria-hidden="true">01</span>
			<h3 class="how-title">Define</h3>
			<p class="how-desc">Keep instructions, skills, and MCP configuration in <code>.agents/</code> — the single source of truth.</p>
			<pre class="how-snippet"><code>.agents/AGENTS.md</code></pre>
		</li>
		<li class="how-step">
			<span class="how-num" aria-hidden="true">02</span>
			<h3 class="how-title">Apply</h3>
			<p class="how-desc">Run one command. AgentSync materializes native symlinks — no copies, no drift.</p>
			<pre class="how-snippet"><code>$ agentsync apply
✔ Linked: CLAUDE.md -&gt; .agents/AGENTS.md</code></pre>
		</li>
		<li class="how-step">
			<span class="how-num" aria-hidden="true">03</span>
			<h3 class="how-title">Synced</h3>
			<p class="how-desc">Every assistant reads the same files. Verify the state anytime.</p>
			<pre class="how-snippet"><code>✔ OK: CLAUDE.md -&gt; .agents/AGENTS.md
Status: All good</code></pre>
		</li>
	</ol>
</section>

<style>
	.how-section {
		max-width: 1100px;
		margin: var(--as-space-3xl, 64px) auto;
		padding: 0 var(--as-space-lg, 24px);
	}

	.how-heading {
		font-size: clamp(1.5rem, 3vw, 2rem);
		font-weight: 700;
		text-align: center;
		margin: 0 0 var(--as-space-xl, 32px) 0;
		color: var(--as-text-primary, #fff);
	}

	.how-grid {
		display: grid;
		grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);
		gap: var(--as-space-lg, 24px);
		list-style: none;
		margin: 0;
		padding: 0;
		counter-reset: how;
	}

	.how-step {
		display: flex;
		flex-direction: column;
		gap: var(--as-space-sm, 8px);
		min-width: 0;
		padding: var(--as-space-lg, 24px);
		background: var(--as-bg-card, rgba(18, 18, 24, 0.6));
		backdrop-filter: blur(12px);
		-webkit-backdrop-filter: blur(12px);
		border: 1px solid var(--as-border, rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08));
		border-radius: var(--as-radius-lg, 16px);
	}

	.how-num {
		font-family: var(--as-font-mono, ui-monospace, monospace);
		font-size: 0.8rem;
		font-weight: 700;
		color: var(--as-primary, #00e5c4);
		letter-spacing: 0.08em;
	}

	.how-title {
		font-size: 1.1rem;
		font-weight: 600;
		margin: 0;
		color: var(--as-text-primary, #fff);
	}

	.how-desc {
		font-size: 0.9rem;
		color: var(--as-text-secondary, #9aa7b3);
		margin: 0;
		line-height: 1.5;
	}

	.how-snippet {
		margin: var(--as-space-sm, 8px) 0 0 0;
		font-size: 0.8rem;
		min-width: 0;
		overflow-x: auto;
	}

	@media (max-width: 900px) {
		.how-grid {
			grid-template-columns: 1fr;
		}
	}
</style>
